    },
    "%@ Click to enable/disable a group. Hold ⌥ Option to disable all other groups while enabling only the selected one." : {
      "comment" : "53438 - Group activation help describing the Option-click exclusive activation shortcut. Preserve the icon placeholder at the beginning of the translation."
    },
    "%@ Configuration Protection can make color mode changes persistent." : {
