    "⚠️ A custom filter with this name already exists." : {
      "comment" : "50000 - Validation warning for a duplicate custom image filter name."
    },
    "⚠️ An alternate EDID identity is in effect - system configuration changes will be tied to this identity!" : {
      "comment" : "53438 - Display configuration warning when overridden EDID identification data is active; system settings are associated with that identity, not the original one."
    },
    "⚠️ An EDID write operation modifies the EDID and DisplayID data on the device itself. Erroneous EDID data or a problem during EDID write might render the display permanently unusable!\n\nMost displays do not allow EDID write for security reasons, some displays require EDID write to be activated in a service menu. Most EDID emulators or pass-thru dongles support EDID write. EDID write (if supported) usually works over HDMI." : {
      "comment" : "50000 - Hardware EDID write warning. This changes device-stored identification data, not a software override."
    },
    "⚠️ Another controller (%@) is taking precedence for %@." : {
      "comment" : "50000 - Controller conflict warning; placeholders identify the controller and affected control or device.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "⚠️ Another controller (%1$@) is taking precedence for %2$@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⚠️ CLI designation clashes with the designation of an existing control." : {
      "comment" : "50000 - Custom control validation: CLI designations must be unique."
    },
    "⚠️ Connection mode was automatically switched to Simple Manifest because the full manifest signature was denied by the device." : {
      "comment" : "50000 - Device connection status for fallback to the Simple Manifest protocol mode."
    },
    "⚠️ EDID data cannot be interpreted (might be invalid)." : {
      "comment" : "50000 - Warning for unparseable display identification data."
    },
    "⚠️ EDID data retrieval failed." : {
      "comment" : "50000 - Warning when display identification data could not be retrieved."
    },
    "⚠️ EDID write is not available for the supplied EDID as its size exceeds 256 bytes." : {
      "comment" : "50000 - EDID write size limit warning; the supplied data exceeds 256 bytes."
    },
    "⚠️ For best results, stick close to the display aspect ratio!" : {
      "comment" : "50000 - Aspect ratio advice for custom display dimensions or resolutions."
    },
    "⚠️ For this XDR display it is best to set calibration to Default - Auto Calibrate so the app can automatically adapt upscaling to the currently selected Apple Display Preset and environmental factors. For manual calibration set the brightness slider as high as possible while also making sure you still see the smiling face!" : {
      "comment" : "50000 - XDR brightness upscaling calibration help; the smiling face is a visual calibration target."
    },
    "⚠️ Full screen streaming is unavailable as it requires Screen Recording permissions. You can grant this under System Settings > Privacy & Security > Screen Recording!" : {
      "comment" : "50000 - Full-screen streaming permission warning pointing to macOS Screen Recording settings."
    },
    "⚠️ If a third party app is being used to show the OSD, you might want to disable the built-in OSD under Keyboard/OSD to avoid having duplicated or mixed-style OSDs presented!" : {
      "comment" : "50000 - OSD integration help: disable the built-in on-screen indicator when using a third-party provider."
    },
    "⚠️ If you want to mirror/stream the virtual screen to a natively connected display only to get flexible HiDPI resolutions, it is recommended to use the flexible scaling feature instead if possible! If you want to use mirroring instead of streaming, this can be enabled in the app menu once the virtual screen is connected." : {
      "comment" : "50000 - Virtual screen help recommending flexible scaling for native displays when only flexible HiDPI resolutions are needed."
    },
    "⚠️ Intel Macs do not support software brightness upscaling while color-table adjustments are enabled. Disable color-table control to use the compositor or Metal overlay path." : {
      "comment" : "50000 - Intel GPU limitation affecting software brightness upscaling with color-table adjustments."
    },
    "⚠️ It is recommended to have more leeway in the range!" : {
      "comment" : "50000 - Warning when configured minimum and maximum resolution dimensions leave too little flexibility."
    },
    "⚠️ Layout protection is disabled for this display group." : {
      "comment" : "50000 - Display group layout protection status."
    },
    "⚠️ macOS already supports standby/wake over HDMI-CEC with most compatible hardware - leave this off to avoid conflict." : {
      "comment" : "50000 - HDMI-CEC power control help warning about conflicts with native macOS behavior."
    },
    "⚠️ Metal performance might be degraded on this device with an integrated Intel GPU." : {
      "comment" : "50000 - Metal rendering performance warning for integrated Intel graphics."
    },
    "⚠️ Minimum width/height value should be lower than the maximum!" : {
      "comment" : "50000 - Validation warning for minimum and maximum display dimensions."
    },
    "⚠️ Missing or duplicated identifier present - this will yield unexpected results!" : {
      "comment" : "50000 - Validation warning for missing or duplicate identifiers."
    },
    "⚠️ No display groups are available." : {
      "comment" : "50000 - Empty state warning when no display groups exist."
    },
    "⚠️ Notifications are turned off for the app. Fix this under System Settings > Notifications!" : {
      "comment" : "50000 - macOS notification permission warning; Notifications is the system settings pane, not software updates."
    },
    "⚠️ Remote control operations seem to be denied by the unit with the selected connection mode." : {
      "comment" : "50000 - Device controller warning for denied remote operations under the selected connection mode."
    },
    "⚠️ Requires appropriate configuration on the device: disabled 'Auto Power Sync' or 'HDMI-CEC' to avoid control conflict and enabled 'QuickStart+', 'Always Ready' and 'Turn on via Wi-Fi' ('Networked Standby')." : {
      "comment" : "50000 - TV power control prerequisites; retain recognizable device firmware setting names."
