    "Layout Protection" : {
      "comment" : "50000 - Display group arrangement protection feature."
    },
    "Layout protection enforces a configured arrangement for group member displays relative to each other. The feature can be used to make sure the displays are arranged properly after changing display resolutions, connecting new displays that are not part of the display group or dealing with displays that are not properly handled by the built-in display layout management of the operating system." : {
