    "Let the app control screen brightness using Apple's display control service." : {
      "comment" : "50000 - Native Apple brightness service setting help."
    },
    "Let the app handle native audio (volume, mute) keys on your Apple keyboard. This lets you control the volume of external displays with your Apple keyboard." : {
      "comment" : "53429 - Native audio key handling help. Native keys are the standard system brightness or audio keys, including those on external Apple keyboards."
    },
    "Let the app handle native brightness keys on your Apple keyboard. This lets you control the brightness of external displays with your Apple keyboard and also allows XDR upscaling keyboard control and extra dimming for native Apple displays." : {
      "comment" : "53429 - Native brightness key handling help. Native keys are the standard system brightness or audio keys, including those on external Apple keyboards."
    },
    "Let the Tools menu behave like the display menus." : {
      "comment" : "50000 - Tools menu collapsible behavior help."
    },
    "Let the virtual screen auto-connect when the associated display is connected. Enabling this will cause the virtual screen to be connected right after creation!" : {
      "comment" : "50000 - Virtual screen auto-connection help."
    },
    "Let the virtual screen follow the orientation of the associated display when it is rotated." : {
      "comment" : "53454 - Help for the virtual-screen association option that automatically follows the associated display’s orientation when that display is rotated."
    },
    "Let UI size be matched among members of the display group when the resolution of a watched group member display changes. This feature works best on displays with flexible scaling enabled." : {
