    "When disabled, brightness is controlled using software adjustments or dimming rather than hardware controls. This also affects the availability of combined brightness control." : {
      "comment" : "50000 - Hardware brightness control setting help."
    },
    "When disabled, icons are hidden for command menu items and inactive expandable menu items. Active state icons and slider icons remain visible." : {
