    "Window Shadow" : {
      "comment" : "50000 - Window shadow appearance setting."
    },
    "Wireless" : {
      "comment" : "50000 - Wireless connection type."
    },
    "With settings transfer, this display's settings will be replaced by the selected disconnected display's settings. This can be used to reassign display settings when a display's identifiers change or when app settings were imported or migrated from a different installation." : {
      "comment" : "50000 - Display settings transfer confirmation help."
    },
    "With this enabled scale matching will affect displays that have resolution configuration protection enabled. The protected resolution will be updated as well." : {
      "comment" : "50000 - UI scale matching protected resolution setting help."
    },
    "With this enabled the app will perform the scale matching operation when the resolution of a watched display is changed by the system or by some other app. If the resolutions of multiple watched displays are changed (for example, because of a layout change), no action is taken to avoid ambiguity." : {
      "comment" : "50000 - UI scale matching external changes setting help."
    },
    "With this enabled, Sidecar displays disconnected using the app will remain in the display list for easy reconnect. Sidecar displays disconnected outside of the app or before app startup are not listed." : {
      "comment" : "50000 - Remember disconnected Sidecar displays setting help."
    },
    "With this option selected, the app will leave native brightness keys under macOS control if only Apple displays are connected with no additional software brightness control features enabled. In this case however various settings (like \"Make fine scale default\" or control \"All suitable screens\" simultaneously) that modify the default behavior of the brightness keys will not apply." : {
      "comment" : "50000 - Native brightness key handling exception help."
